==Description== <!--T:3-->

<!--T:4-->
The [[Image:Silk_ControlGridNStar66.svg|24px]] '''Silk ControlGridNStar66''' command creates a blended multi corner grid, a ControlGridNStar66 object, from three or more [[Image:Silk_SubGrid63_2Surf64.svg|16px]] [[Silk_SubGrid63_2Surf64|corner sub-grids]].

