==Usage== <!--T:6-->

<!--T:7-->
# Select all [[Image:Silk_SubGrid63_2Surf64.svg|16px]] [[Silk_SubGrid63_2Surf64|corner sub-grids]] surrounding the gap sequentially in counter-clockwise direction (looking from the outer side).
# There are several ways to invoke the command.
#* Press the {{Button|[[Image:Silk_ControlGridNStar66.svg|16px]] ControlGridNStar66}} button.
#* Select the {{MenuCommand|Silk → [[Image:Silk_ControlGridNStar66.svg|16px]] ControlGridNStar66}} option from the menu.
# A blended corner grid, a '''ControlGridNStar66''' object, is created.

== Properties == <!--T:8-->

<!--T:9-->
See also: [[Property_View|Property View]].

<!--T:10-->
A blended multi corner grid, a'''ControlGridNStar66''' object, is derived from a [[Part_Feature|Part feature]], or more precise a {{Incode|Part::FeaturePython}} object, and inherits all its properties. It also has the following additional property:

=== Data === <!--T:11-->

<!--T:12-->
{{Properties_Title|ControlGridNStar66_NSub}}

<!--T:13-->
* {{PropertyData|Legs|Part::PropertyGeometryList}}: Control segments.
* {{PropertyData|N|Integer|hidden}}: Shows the number of surfaces to blend.
* {{PropertyData|SquishDiag4|Integer}}: Default is {{value|0}}. Squish diagonal.
* {{PropertyData|StarGrid|PythonObject}}: Poles.
* {{PropertyData|SubList|LinkList}}: Reference Sub-Grids.


